<title>FINLAND: Hackman sees slightly positive '97 result.</title>
<headline>Hackman sees slightly positive '97 result.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consumer goods group Oy Hackman Ab's CEO Tapio Hintikka said on Wednesday he expected the group to show a slight profit in 1997 compared to last year's 23.6 million markka loss after financial items.</p>
<p>&quot;This year we should make a slightly positive result,&quot; Hintikka told a news conference.</p>
<p>Looking further ahead, he said: &quot;I don't promise a good result in 1999 but I believe in a satisfactory result in 1999.&quot;</p>
<p>Hintikka became CEO of Hackman at the start of this year.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
